msgid "To see anything against your account"
msgstr "Para ver cualquier cosa en contra de tu cuenta"

#. Follows the step's bold start and its colon, so it begins in lower case in English.
#, fuzzy,machine-translated
msgctxt "help.settings.step6.how"
msgid "Advanced holds Discord and keys for your own tools; About this world, the version and the rules."
msgstr "Avanzado guarda Discord y claves para tus propias herramientas; Sobre este mundo, la versión y las reglas."

#. The bold start of one step, before a colon: what the player wants to do.
#, fuzzy,machine-translated
