msgstr "pulsa un rol: una empresa, un banco, un periódico, un partido, una unidad o un cargo."

#. The bold start of one step, before a colon: what the player wants to do.
#, fuzzy,machine-translated
msgctxt "help.you.step1.to"
msgid "To go to something you run"
msgstr "Para ir a algo que diriges"

#. Follows the step's bold start and its colon, so it begins in lower case in English.
#, fuzzy,machine-translated
