msgstr "pulsa Crear algo. Cada línea dice cuánto cuesta y qué necesitas antes."

#. The bold start of one step, before a colon: what the player wants to do.
#, fuzzy,machine-translated
msgctxt "help.you.step2.to"
msgid "To start something of your own"
msgstr "Para crear algo propio"

#. Follows the step's bold start and its colon, so it begins in lower case in English.
#, fuzzy,machine-translated
msgctxt "help.you.step3.how"
